# Harness OUTPUT only — captured screenshots from `npm run shot` / the checks.
# Only images may live here. A .mjs dropped in this folder now shows up as
# untracked in `git status` instead of vanishing: harness code is tracked code
# and belongs in scripts/. (The old blanket `scripts/.shots/` rule swallowed 10
# driver scripts written during iterations 11-13 — see AGENTS.md > Self-verifying.)
scripts/.shots/**/*.png
scripts/.shots/**/*.jpg
scripts/.shots/**/*.jpeg
.wrangler/
scripts/.strips/**/*.png
scripts/.strips/**/*.jpg
